=== LVGL HMI Human Machine Interaction ===
This example shows that the ESP32-P4 displays LVGL images through the MIPI DSI interface, which fully demonstrates the powerful image processing capabilities of the ESP32-P4

==== Hardware Required ====
*7inch display and accessories
*ESP32-P4-ETH [Host]
==== Screen Wake-Up Steps====
#The 7inch screen driver has been packaged as a component, and the component is located at [https://components.espressif.com/components/waveshare/esp_lcd_ili9881c/ ESP Component Registry]<br/>
#After opening the project, select <code>esp32p4</code> core, and you can directly click 🔥 to compile, flash, monitor. Upon completion, you can view the screen:

[[File:600px-ESP32-P4-Module-DEV-KIT_250326_02.png|400px]]
